(3867299, 544789, 44825, '<td valign="top">Do you mean that dot centre shot? Shots like these have caused me to buy bigger and better cameras over the years! It''s so frustrating when you can clearly see something but the camera optics refuse to do it justice.<br/> <br/>I usually ended up reverting to the Mk1 Eyeball and just telling everyone about it.<br/> <br/>I might have improved the shot if the horizon were level - sharks can''t swim uphill!:)</td>', 'Do you mean that dot centre shot? Shots like these have caused me to buy bigger and better cameras over the years! It''s so frustrating when you can clearly see something but the camera optics refuse to do it justice. I usually ended up reverting to the Mk1 Eyeball and just telling everyone about it. I might have improved the shot if the horizon were level - sharks can''t swim uphill!:)', '2007-07-04 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867308, 546661, 66201, '<td valign="top">Aw that''s just not fair!!! Great capture.</td>', 'Aw that''s just not fair!!! Great capture.', '2007-07-04 12:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867312, 546354, 66201, '<td valign="top">Oh yes - I remember that ferry boat...and those gulls. Nice lighting on the water.</td>', 'Oh yes - I remember that ferry boat...and those gulls. Nice lighting on the water.', '2007-07-04 12:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867314, 547448, 66201, '<td valign="top">very pretty. Love the blueness.</td>', 'very pretty. Love the blueness.', '2007-07-04 12:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867316, 546292, 45377, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2007-07-04 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867325, 547352, 80311, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2007-07-04 12:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867327, 547071, 57882, '<td valign="top">Fantastically eerie scene.  Well done.</td>', 'Fantastically eerie scene.  Well done.', '2007-07-04 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867333, 547351, 45857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, weak on topic, perhaps better in land...</td>', 'Beautiful picture, weak on topic, perhaps better in land...', '2007-07-04 12:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867335, 546320, 45377, '<td valign="top">Could almost be another planet. A little too much foreground and not enough sky for my taste. Good exposure.</td>', 'Could almost be another planet. A little too much foreground and not enough sky for my taste. Good exposure.', '2007-07-04 12:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867343, 545823, 66201, '<td valign="top">I think firstly, your title is self-destructive. Secondly there is more sky than water in this image: different cropping would have placed more emphasis on the water. The red hue is dramatic and there is nice use of silhouetted mountains.</td>', 'I think firstly, your title is self-destructive. Secondly there is more sky than water in this image: different cropping would have placed more emphasis on the water. The red hue is dramatic and there is nice use of silhouetted mountains.', '2007-07-04 12:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867355, 547478, 44825, '<td valign="top">Your focus looks a little off and IMO there isn''t much water.</td>', 'Your focus looks a little off and IMO there isn''t much water.', '2007-07-04 12:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867364, 546336, 44825, '<td valign="top">Love the sky</td>', 'Love the sky', '2007-07-04 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867369, 547846, 44825, '<td valign="top">Nice sky</td>', 'Nice sky', '2007-07-04 12:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867388, 548106, 45377, '<td valign="top">A beautiful moon lit night, reflection on sea draws your eye in but too much negative space on both sides of the pic, seems to reduce the impact. Perhaps tighter cropping or different exposure setting.</td>', 'A beautiful moon lit night, reflection on sea draws your eye in but too much negative space on both sides of the pic, seems to reduce the impact. Perhaps tighter cropping or different exposure setting.', '2007-07-04 12:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
