(3867672, 547891, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice line and composition but the color seems over saturated to me. I sense a slight tilt to the right with the horizon as well.</td>', 'Nice line and composition but the color seems over saturated to me. I sense a slight tilt to the right with the horizon as well.', '2007-07-04 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
