(3867686, 544527, 15711, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha - Nicely done. I might''ve upped the depth of the mid tones a smidge but still a nice shot. 7</td>', 'ha ha ha - Nicely done. I might''ve upped the depth of the mid tones a smidge but still a nice shot. 7', '2007-07-04 13:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
