(3868964, 547352, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is the first image I am voting on in this challenge and I have to say that I really like it.  the feel of it is just great.  I like the houses up on the hill behind the boats and the way it is all tied together.  If I had to nitpick I would say that I wish the lower portion of the photo were a bit brighter.  But it is still an awesome photo and I give it a 7.</td>', 'This is the first image I am voting on in this challenge and I have to say that I really like it.  the feel of it is just great.  I like the houses up on the hill behind the boats and the way it is all tied together.  If I had to nitpick I would say that I wish the lower portion of the photo were a bit brighter.  But it is still an awesome photo and I give it a 7.', '2007-07-04 20:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868977, 547247, 63267, '<td valign="top">I have a photo that is similar to this in some aspects and it always drives me nutts when people pick it as their favorite of mine.  Yours looks like it is the sun rather than the moon and that the exposure is very dark because of that.  I may be wrong, but the slight cloud formation leads to me to see it this way.  What I am not seeing on this picture is a good anchor point.  My eyes are bouncing from the light in the sky to the bright light on the water and with that I feel as though my retinas are burning.  Overall I can''t say that I am overly impressed or wowed by the photo so I am leaving it with a 5.</td>', 'I have a photo that is similar to this in some aspects and it always drives me nutts when people pick it as their favorite of mine.  Yours looks like it is the sun rather than the moon and that the exposure is very dark because of that.  I may be wrong, but the slight cloud formation leads to me to see it this way.  What I am not seeing on this picture is a good anchor point.  My eyes are bouncing from the light in the sky to the bright light on the water and with that I feel as though my retinas are burning.  Overall I can''t say that I am overly impressed or wowed by the photo so I am leaving it with a 5.', '2007-07-04 20:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868992, 546336, 63267, '<td valign="top">When I look at this photo I think this is a technically correct photo.  You have the rule of thirds where your horizon is in the lower third.  You have a strong lead in with the sillhouetted rocks.  You have a great exposure that brings out the rays of the sun, the patterns and details in the clouds and the nice colors to go with it all.  Overall this is just a great photo and one that I am sure you are ready to print and hang on the wall.  Nicely captured and well done! 8</td>', 'When I look at this photo I think this is a technically correct photo.  You have the rule of thirds where your horizon is in the lower third.  You have a strong lead in with the sillhouetted rocks.  You have a great exposure that brings out the rays of the sun, the patterns and details in the clouds and the nice colors to go with it all.  Overall this is just a great photo and one that I am sure you are ready to print and hang on the wall.  Nicely captured and well done! 8', '2007-07-04 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868995, 547801, 63267, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition of this photo, but I don''t like the lighting in the lower left hand of the picture.  It also looks like the shell is out of focus and I think that is what you were trying to capture by your title. 5</td>', 'I really like this composition of this photo, but I don''t like the lighting in the lower left hand of the picture.  It also looks like the shell is out of focus and I think that is what you were trying to capture by your title. 5', '2007-07-04 20:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869017, 547545, 63267, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at the texture in those clouds. Isn''t it amazing how some cloud formations can have such unique textures to them?  This photo really looks nice, good use of the thirds to capitalize on the sea, and excellent colors.  Well done. 7</td>', 'Wow, look at the texture in those clouds. Isn''t it amazing how some cloud formations can have such unique textures to them?  This photo really looks nice, good use of the thirds to capitalize on the sea, and excellent colors.  Well done. 7', '2007-07-04 20:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869018, 547664, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here, but I don''t like the pylon in the lower left.  Overall I wish it were a little brighter as well. 5</td>', 'I like what you were going for here, but I don''t like the pylon in the lower left.  Overall I wish it were a little brighter as well. 5', '2007-07-04 20:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869022, 545519, 63267, '<td valign="top">Interesting job of framing the sea with the peep hole.  Although it is probably one of the more unique images here, I hope the voters don''t ding you because it lacks the wow factor.  I know it would be tough to go, but some texture on the rocks inside the cave could really help this.  6</td>', 'Interesting job of framing the sea with the peep hole.  Although it is probably one of the more unique images here, I hope the voters don''t ding you because it lacks the wow factor.  I know it would be tough to go, but some texture on the rocks inside the cave could really help this.  6', '2007-07-04 20:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869026, 544362, 63267, '<td valign="top">The horizon looks crooked.  The blown out water doesn''t helpt the image, but the bright colors on the sail are nice.  Overall I think this could be a great image, if it was edited a little better, or taken at a better time of day. 5</td>', 'The horizon looks crooked.  The blown out water doesn''t helpt the image, but the bright colors on the sail are nice.  Overall I think this could be a great image, if it was edited a little better, or taken at a better time of day. 5', '2007-07-04 20:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869029, 547876, 63267, '<td valign="top">I love seeing old ships like this.  I can see how your tone matches the old feel of the ship, but the blacks look too dark to me and the sky looks too pink. I can see hints of clouds here that make me think a little better PP could have brought those detaisl otu and really made this old ship shine. 6</td>', 'I love seeing old ships like this.  I can see how your tone matches the old feel of the ship, but the blacks look too dark to me and the sky looks too pink. I can see hints of clouds here that make me think a little better PP could have brought those detaisl otu and really made this old ship shine. 6', '2007-07-04 20:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869032, 546456, 78867, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2007-07-04 20:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869033, 547035, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like how you have captured this.  I wish there was a tad more sky though.  Not a lot, but just a little bit more to move that horizon down a smidge.  Overall a nice picture. 7</td>', 'I like how you have captured this.  I wish there was a tad more sky though.  Not a lot, but just a little bit more to move that horizon down a smidge.  Overall a nice picture. 7', '2007-07-04 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869036, 547995, 63267, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t speak to me too well.  I don''t care for the overly dark image.  I am sure there are those that will, but this just doesn''t move me too much.  Sorry for the honesty.  The horizon is nice and straighter and the composition looks good, I just can''t get over the darkenss. 5</td>', 'This one doesn''t speak to me too well.  I don''t care for the overly dark image.  I am sure there are those that will, but this just doesn''t move me too much.  Sorry for the honesty.  The horizon is nice and straighter and the composition looks good, I just can''t get over the darkenss. 5', '2007-07-04 20:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
