(3869322, 544540, 63267, '<td valign="top">Oh my, where have I seen this photo before?  I am amazed that this ship still hasn''t moved.  I think I even saw this title as a title to the thread.  Because of this I think you lose out on some of the originiality that this photo may have garnered.  Overall it is a very pleasing image and one that I am sure you will enjoy showing people for years to come.  Had it not been shown previously I would have easily given you an 8, but as I said the wow factor has diminished as I have already seen this work and the accompanying videos on the internet that were posted with it.  therefore I must give you a 6.</td>', 'Oh my, where have I seen this photo before?  I am amazed that this ship still hasn''t moved.  I think I even saw this title as a title to the thread.  Because of this I think you lose out on some of the originiality that this photo may have garnered.  Overall it is a very pleasing image and one that I am sure you will enjoy showing people for years to come.  Had it not been shown previously I would have easily given you an 8, but as I said the wow factor has diminished as I have already seen this work and the accompanying videos on the internet that were posted with it.  therefore I must give you a 6.', '2007-07-04 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869325, 545503, 63267, '<td valign="top">Pretty water.  Overall it looks a bit soft though on the people.  Is this a heavy crop?  6</td>', 'Pretty water.  Overall it looks a bit soft though on the people.  Is this a heavy crop?  6', '2007-07-04 22:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869329, 548064, 63267, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a lot here to really make me want to stare at this picture.  Overall, I find it kind of boring.  Sorry but I have to say 5.</td>', 'I don''t see a lot here to really make me want to stare at this picture.  Overall, I find it kind of boring.  Sorry but I have to say 5.', '2007-07-04 22:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869333, 547829, 63267, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with the whole natural fram and everything, but I don''t think it really works with this image.  I would rather the emphasis be placed on the ship in the sea then on the frame.  5</td>', 'I see where you were going with the whole natural fram and everything, but I don''t think it really works with this image.  I would rather the emphasis be placed on the ship in the sea then on the frame.  5', '2007-07-04 22:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
