(3869362, 546456, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, good composition, and a strong subject.  If only the water were a bit softer from a longer exposure. Still a great image and one of the better ones I have seen. 8</td>', 'Very nice lighting, good composition, and a strong subject.  If only the water were a bit softer from a longer exposure. Still a great image and one of the better ones I have seen. 8', '2007-07-04 22:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
