(3869371, 547971, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is going to be another favorite of the voters.  the strong lines of the pier supports really look great.  but the one drawback I see is a little bit of a crooked horizon.  I see a slight slant to the right.  Still worth a 7 though.</td>', 'This is going to be another favorite of the voters.  the strong lines of the pier supports really look great.  but the one drawback I see is a little bit of a crooked horizon.  I see a slight slant to the right.  Still worth a 7 though.', '2007-07-04 22:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
