(3869987, 547271, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I really like the blue look as it conveys evening.  The pier is a stron line leading into the photo.  I do wish however that the sky wasn''t cropped so much.  If the pier had been a little lower and the sky a little more visible this would have really tickeled my fancy.  Still a great photo and worth a 7.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I really like the blue look as it conveys evening.  The pier is a stron line leading into the photo.  I do wish however that the sky wasn''t cropped so much.  If the pier had been a little lower and the sky a little more visible this would have really tickeled my fancy.  Still a great photo and worth a 7.', '2007-07-05 03:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869992, 547448, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very well composed.  Lighting looks good, straight horizon.  A really nice photo.  but it seems to have a grey cast to it that I think detracts from the overall image and prevents the little color that is there from shining.  Perhaps this would have been better as a BW.  Still a nice photo and worthy of a 6.</td>', 'Very well composed.  Lighting looks good, straight horizon.  A really nice photo.  but it seems to have a grey cast to it that I think detracts from the overall image and prevents the little color that is there from shining.  Perhaps this would have been better as a BW.  Still a nice photo and worthy of a 6.', '2007-07-05 03:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869994, 545292, 63267, '<td valign="top">The horizon looks crooekd here and the blown out sky really hampers the shot.  The egret looks soft. I think you could do a lot more with this photograph.  Maybe crop the skly entirely out.  Shapren the egret a bit.  5.</td>', 'The horizon looks crooekd here and the blown out sky really hampers the shot.  The egret looks soft. I think you could do a lot more with this photograph.  Maybe crop the skly entirely out.  Shapren the egret a bit.  5.', '2007-07-05 03:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
