(3870042, 547387, 63267, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as serentiy myself.  Not with the small wave crashing around the rocks.  However I do enjoy sitting by the rocks and watching the waves crash, but I think I enjoy the power and the feeling that we are so minimal to the natural powers.  This is a nice photo though, the lightring is good, you captured some water movement to give the photo life and the colors are good.  Overall I think it is worth a 7.</td>', 'I don''t see this as serentiy myself.  Not with the small wave crashing around the rocks.  However I do enjoy sitting by the rocks and watching the waves crash, but I think I enjoy the power and the feeling that we are so minimal to the natural powers.  This is a nice photo though, the lightring is good, you captured some water movement to give the photo life and the colors are good.  Overall I think it is worth a 7.', '2007-07-05 04:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
