(3871112, 546264, 57260, '<td valign="top">I like the sky. Something about the reflection on the water bugs me a little - that blackish border around the reflection and it seems a little contrasty. You also have a dust spot on your sensor just to the left of the light breking through the clouds. Overall nice picture. 6</td>', 'I like the sky. Something about the reflection on the water bugs me a little - that blackish border around the reflection and it seems a little contrasty. You also have a dust spot on your sensor just to the left of the light breking through the clouds. Overall nice picture. 6', '2007-07-05 12:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871116, 548111, 57260, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Nice long exposure. 8</td>', 'Love the colors. Nice long exposure. 8', '2007-07-05 12:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871123, 547281, 57260, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the noise is intentional but I feel it would''ve been better if you cleaned it up. Also the focus seems very soft especially towards the edges.</td>', 'Not sure if the noise is intentional but I feel it would''ve been better if you cleaned it up. Also the focus seems very soft especially towards the edges.', '2007-07-05 12:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
