(3871613, 547281, 72916, '<td valign="top">I think the noise really adds to the picture, but the sky seems a bit overpowering.</td>', 'I think the noise really adds to the picture, but the sky seems a bit overpowering.', '2007-07-05 14:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872158, 547238, 72916, '<td valign="top">I love the time lapse, great colors also.</td>', 'I love the time lapse, great colors also.', '2007-07-05 16:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872163, 547917, 72916, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and the single red color is amazing.</td>', 'Great composition, and the single red color is amazing.', '2007-07-05 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872167, 544636, 72916, '<td valign="top">Love the sky, but the sea doesn''t match the cloud in quality.</td>', 'Love the sky, but the sea doesn''t match the cloud in quality.', '2007-07-05 16:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872170, 546661, 72916, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great action photo.</td>', 'Nice shot. Great action photo.', '2007-07-05 16:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872179, 546780, 72916, '<td valign="top">The lens definitely makes this picture interesting.</td>', 'The lens definitely makes this picture interesting.', '2007-07-05 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872190, 547917, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice angles and POV...I like how you''ve placed the primary subject in the foreground .  The grayish tones make it look a bit cold, yet the water still seems very inviting.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice angles and POV...I like how you''ve placed the primary subject in the foreground .  The grayish tones make it look a bit cold, yet the water still seems very inviting.  Well done!', '2007-07-05 16:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872196, 547664, 72916, '<td valign="top">The contrast is nice, but the ocean seems dwarfed by the sun.</td>', 'The contrast is nice, but the ocean seems dwarfed by the sun.', '2007-07-05 16:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872202, 547326, 72916, '<td valign="top">I love the soft colors and the way the photo is set up. Nice work.</td>', 'I love the soft colors and the way the photo is set up. Nice work.', '2007-07-05 16:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872206, 545317, 72916, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Is there any chance you could pm me with a little more detail about how you took this shot. Thanks.</td>', 'Nice shot. Is there any chance you could pm me with a little more detail about how you took this shot. Thanks.', '2007-07-05 16:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872208, 546802, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very neat feel generated from the water rushing over the rocks and how the light catches on the turbulence.  Beautiful...well done!</td>', 'Very neat feel generated from the water rushing over the rocks and how the light catches on the turbulence.  Beautiful...well done!', '2007-07-05 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872217, 547525, 72916, '<td valign="top">First undersea shot I''ve seen yet, and a very nice one at that.</td>', 'First undersea shot I''ve seen yet, and a very nice one at that.', '2007-07-05 16:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872233, 546661, 42100, '<td valign="top">It would be very cool to see a killer whale leaping from the water like that.  You are very lucky to have had that experience.  This is very well framed...you keep the whale as the primary subject.  But you also give it place with the distant terrain without overwhelming Mr. Orca.  Great photo!</td>', 'It would be very cool to see a killer whale leaping from the water like that.  You are very lucky to have had that experience.  This is very well framed...you keep the whale as the primary subject.  But you also give it place with the distant terrain without overwhelming Mr. Orca.  Great photo!', '2007-07-05 16:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872241, 548035, 42100, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful twilight light...makes the photo very moody.  The composition is nicely balanced.  Great job!</td>', 'Really beautiful twilight light...makes the photo very moody.  The composition is nicely balanced.  Great job!', '2007-07-05 16:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872261, 544362, 42100, '<td valign="top">The light on the sail makes it glow very nicely...but the sunlight reflected on the water is way to harsh and takes away from the interesting sailboat and silhouetted skyline.</td>', 'The light on the sail makes it glow very nicely...but the sunlight reflected on the water is way to harsh and takes away from the interesting sailboat and silhouetted skyline.', '2007-07-05 17:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872275, 544789, 42100, '<td valign="top">The wave doesn''t have enough texture or pattern to carry this photo...a more defining subject could give this more interest and help balance the composition.</td>', 'The wave doesn''t have enough texture or pattern to carry this photo...a more defining subject could give this more interest and help balance the composition.', '2007-07-05 17:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872291, 544326, 42100, '<td valign="top">Having the horizon split the middle photo rarely works well, they leave compositions looking very static.  If the boat on the right was a little more left and slightly lower in the frame the photo could be a little more dynamic.</td>', 'Having the horizon split the middle photo rarely works well, they leave compositions looking very static.  If the boat on the right was a little more left and slightly lower in the frame the photo could be a little more dynamic.', '2007-07-05 17:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872314, 545292, 77192, '<td valign="top">slightly over blue cast for me and I think I''d like to see the sky less washed out</td>', 'slightly over blue cast for me and I think I''d like to see the sky less washed out', '2007-07-05 17:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872316, 546802, 77192, '<td valign="top">nice use of a slow shutter speed :-)</td>', 'nice use of a slow shutter speed :-)', '2007-07-05 17:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872319, 547478, 42100, '<td valign="top">You''re foreground seems considerably less sharp than the rest of the photo.  You either need a smaller aperture for more depth to get all in focus.   Or have focus on the torch and foreground instead as they seem to be the main subject(let the background go out of focus).</td>', 'You''re foreground seems considerably less sharp than the rest of the photo.  You either need a smaller aperture for more depth to get all in focus.   Or have focus on the torch and foreground instead as they seem to be the main subject(let the background go out of focus).', '2007-07-05 17:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872324, 548017, 77192, '<td valign="top">oversaturated maybe? nicely composed though?</td>', 'oversaturated maybe? nicely composed though?', '2007-07-05 17:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872326, 548111, 77192, '<td valign="top">great work!</td>', 'great work!', '2007-07-05 17:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872349, 546373, 42100, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught your subject in a great action photo position, but photographically he''s overwhelmed by the wave and it''s difficult to determine exactly what''s happening.</td>', 'You''ve caught your subject in a great action photo position, but photographically he''s overwhelmed by the wave and it''s difficult to determine exactly what''s happening.', '2007-07-05 17:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872362, 544326, 77192, '<td valign="top">would have like dot have seen a bigger shot.</td>', 'would have like dot have seen a bigger shot.', '2007-07-05 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3872365, 545933, 77192, '<td valign="top">magnificent bright blue</td>', 'magnificent bright blue', '2007-07-05 17:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
