(3872461, 547593, 42100, '<td valign="top">The light is very nice, but the palm tree is dead center and really stops the eye dead in its tracks.  Placing the tree towards the side would help make the photo more dynamic, and it would also give you more room for that great shoreline to the left.</td>', 'The light is very nice, but the palm tree is dead center and really stops the eye dead in its tracks.  Placing the tree towards the side would help make the photo more dynamic, and it would also give you more room for that great shoreline to the left.', '2007-07-05 17:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
