(3875040, 546456, 74017, '<td valign="top">great shot the colors are amazing</td>', 'great shot the colors are amazing', '2007-07-06 10:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875088, 546868, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflections in the water from the trees.  You could get some great abstract photos on those alone.  The canoers and all the red makes a very bold statement, especially against those green reflections.  Beautiful scene and photograph.</td>', 'Very nice reflections in the water from the trees.  You could get some great abstract photos on those alone.  The canoers and all the red makes a very bold statement, especially against those green reflections.  Beautiful scene and photograph.', '2007-07-06 10:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875089, 546456, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful light in this scene...the water is emphasized very nicely by it.  Well done!</td>', 'Very beautiful light in this scene...the water is emphasized very nicely by it.  Well done!', '2007-07-06 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875094, 547793, 42100, '<td valign="top">Fascinating lighthouse actually out there in the sea...but with that rocky coast line it really has a job to do.  Very nice photograph!</td>', 'Fascinating lighthouse actually out there in the sea...but with that rocky coast line it really has a job to do.  Very nice photograph!', '2007-07-06 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875096, 547846, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice light to this photo, those clouds look great...the composition is a bit cluttered side though.</td>', 'Very nice light to this photo, those clouds look great...the composition is a bit cluttered side though.', '2007-07-06 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875099, 547551, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very intense range of colors, from the very warms and to the very cools, all in a relatively small area.  Beautiful sunrise and photograph!</td>', 'Very intense range of colors, from the very warms and to the very cools, all in a relatively small area.  Beautiful sunrise and photograph!', '2007-07-06 10:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875104, 547212, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wow, quite the vista there...lots of great leading lines and texture in those waves.  Very beautiful photograph!</td>', 'Wow, quite the vista there...lots of great leading lines and texture in those waves.  Very beautiful photograph!', '2007-07-06 10:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875107, 547700, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great, great clouds...very composed with the reflections.  The colors are great.  Excellent!</td>', 'Great, great clouds...very composed with the reflections.  The colors are great.  Excellent!', '2007-07-06 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875114, 547660, 42100, '<td valign="top">Really, really like this composition, but find the partial sun obtrusive and distracting.  Beautiful scene, killer light and color!</td>', 'Really, really like this composition, but find the partial sun obtrusive and distracting.  Beautiful scene, killer light and color!', '2007-07-06 11:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875116, 547243, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice layering to this photo...great light as well.  A warm and beautiful photograph!</td>', 'Very nice layering to this photo...great light as well.  A warm and beautiful photograph!', '2007-07-06 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875194, 547041, 39679, '<td valign="top">I have fingerprints on my monitor fromo covering up the stuff on the right...trying to decide if I would have included it or not.  Ultimately I think I would have cropped it out (to my eye it''s a little distracting) but it''s a hard call.  Anyway, really great shot.</td>', 'I have fingerprints on my monitor fromo covering up the stuff on the right...trying to decide if I would have included it or not.  Ultimately I think I would have cropped it out (to my eye it''s a little distracting) but it''s a hard call.  Anyway, really great shot.', '2007-07-06 11:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875198, 547593, 39679, '<td valign="top">I always hesitate making comments about framing because I don''t know what was on either side of the subject but having the palm dead center in the shot is a killer to me.  I''m a pretty avid believer in the rule of thirds. Also, if you had one handy, a polarizer (or good polarized sun glasses for a point and shoot) would have made the sky and sea much richer.  Still, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'I always hesitate making comments about framing because I don''t know what was on either side of the subject but having the palm dead center in the shot is a killer to me.  I''m a pretty avid believer in the rule of thirds. Also, if you had one handy, a polarizer (or good polarized sun glasses for a point and shoot) would have made the sky and sea much richer.  Still, it''s a nice shot.', '2007-07-06 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875206, 547071, 39679, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2007-07-06 11:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875219, 547238, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...what an excellent shot.  I''d be tempted to think that you played with the clouds in photoshop but I''m guessing it''s just a result of a long exposure.  <br/> <br/>There are a lot if really excellent balancing elements in this picture.  The contrast between the sharply focused rocks and the fuzzy clouds makes this shot particularly captivating as does the relative coolness of the water against the warm sunset.  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow...what an excellent shot.  I''d be tempted to think that you played with the clouds in photoshop but I''m guessing it''s just a result of a long exposure.   There are a lot if really excellent balancing elements in this picture.  The contrast between the sharply focused rocks and the fuzzy clouds makes this shot particularly captivating as does the relative coolness of the water against the warm sunset.  Great shot!', '2007-07-06 11:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875222, 548076, 39679, '<td valign="top">That''s some seriously intense color.  I''m assuming you increased the saturation...you may have gone a bit too far...it''s right on the verge but it''s still a nice shot.</td>', 'That''s some seriously intense color.  I''m assuming you increased the saturation...you may have gone a bit too far...it''s right on the verge but it''s still a nice shot.', '2007-07-06 11:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875225, 547756, 58272, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Love the contrasting textures of the pillars(wood vs metal) and the waves. Nice work</td>', 'Whoa! Love the contrasting textures of the pillars(wood vs metal) and the waves. Nice work', '2007-07-06 12:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875233, 547970, 58272, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you were aiming for it but I would prefer the boat to be much more in focus. Also I think that this shot would benefit from some added contrast.</td>', 'Not sure if you were aiming for it but I would prefer the boat to be much more in focus. Also I think that this shot would benefit from some added contrast.', '2007-07-06 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875248, 548081, 39679, '<td valign="top">This a nice shot but probably could be better by following one of the jillions of "rules" in photography...get as close as you can.  <br/> <br/>The point in the center is really interesting and the color difference in the water around it is interesting too.  The rest, to my eye, is just clutter and really distracts from the interest of the point.  I do understand that you were probably standing on a cliff and that you probably can''t levitate to get closer but I thought I''d lend my 2 cents.</td>', 'This a nice shot but probably could be better by following one of the jillions of "rules" in photography...get as close as you can.   The point in the center is really interesting and the color difference in the water around it is interesting too.  The rest, to my eye, is just clutter and really distracts from the interest of the point.  I do understand that you were probably standing on a cliff and that you probably can''t levitate to get closer but I thought I''d lend my 2 cents.', '2007-07-06 12:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875252, 544322, 58272, '<td valign="top">This would look cool with a slight twinge with the hue/sat tool to emphasise the colours in the sunsut.</td>', 'This would look cool with a slight twinge with the hue/sat tool to emphasise the colours in the sunsut.', '2007-07-06 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875257, 546292, 58272, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia here.</td>', 'Love the sepia here.', '2007-07-06 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875260, 546740, 58272, '<td valign="top">Wow, you really lucked out with the sky here.</td>', 'Wow, you really lucked out with the sky here.', '2007-07-06 12:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875267, 548110, 58272, '<td valign="top">Classic composition, could use having something much more in focus as a point to draw the eye to.</td>', 'Classic composition, could use having something much more in focus as a point to draw the eye to.', '2007-07-06 12:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875272, 547801, 58272, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colours.</td>', 'Nice composition and colours.', '2007-07-06 12:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3875273, 547593, 58272, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the palm tree adds to the photo here... Or perhaps have it more to the right as something to frame the shot.</td>', 'Not sure that the palm tree adds to the photo here... Or perhaps have it more to the right as something to frame the shot.', '2007-07-06 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
