(3882654, 546375, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is a well composed image, and the tower and ferris wheel stand out nicely against the background sky.  The foreground is a little too busy for my taste, however.  A long exposure would have smoothed that out and made for a phenomenal photograph in my opinion.</td>', 'This is a well composed image, and the tower and ferris wheel stand out nicely against the background sky.  The foreground is a little too busy for my taste, however.  A long exposure would have smoothed that out and made for a phenomenal photograph in my opinion.', '2007-07-08 17:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3882658, 547829, 67553, '<td valign="top">Nice colors here.  The boat almost looks like a model.  :)  The cave(?) around the outside, however is very distracting and takes away from an otherwise wonderful image.</td>', 'Nice colors here.  The boat almost looks like a model.  :)  The cave(?) around the outside, however is very distracting and takes away from an otherwise wonderful image.', '2007-07-08 17:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
