(3885830, 546375, 71931, '<td valign="top">Blackpool, isn''t it?  Never been there, but I think that''s the tower.</td>', 'Blackpool, isn''t it?  Never been there, but I think that''s the tower.', '2007-07-09 13:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
