(3885846, 547478, 80104, '<td valign="top">should have rotated the picture to fix the tilt...  Unless you wanted the tilt in there and if so it doesn''t seem effective.</td>', 'should have rotated the picture to fix the tilt...  Unless you wanted the tilt in there and if so it doesn''t seem effective.', '2007-07-09 13:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885856, 547281, 71931, '<td valign="top">Zoom in on your target!  We almost can''t see the boat :-(  Yes, you want us to get the point that it''s a small boat, but by making it *so* tiny, all we can really see are clouds.  Crop it as a vertical shot, about a quarter or a third of the width of this shot.</td>', 'Zoom in on your target!  We almost can''t see the boat :-(  Yes, you want us to get the point that it''s a small boat, but by making it *so* tiny, all we can really see are clouds.  Crop it as a vertical shot, about a quarter or a third of the width of this shot.', '2007-07-09 13:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885868, 548017, 71931, '<td valign="top">Great color!  My only quibble is that you could have zoomed in just a little, or cropped it a bit, to lose some of the left edge, thus moving the lighthouse a little farther away from the right edge.  The effect would be just as strong, and the lighthouse would be an even stronger focus.  But this is a minor quibble.</td>', 'Great color!  My only quibble is that you could have zoomed in just a little, or cropped it a bit, to lose some of the left edge, thus moving the lighthouse a little farther away from the right edge.  The effect would be just as strong, and the lighthouse would be an even stronger focus.  But this is a minor quibble.', '2007-07-09 13:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885873, 547912, 71931, '<td valign="top">Beautiful :-)</td>', 'Beautiful :-)', '2007-07-09 13:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885905, 545005, 71931, '<td valign="top">Nice, but not really on the topic.  Getting closer to the swing and getting more of the water in the shot, would have helped.</td>', 'Nice, but not really on the topic.  Getting closer to the swing and getting more of the water in the shot, would have helped.', '2007-07-09 13:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
