(3887794, 547535, 78255, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia treatment it works very well for this image. The wave is captured just right and the gulls in the sky add to the scene.</td>', 'I like the sepia treatment it works very well for this image. The wave is captured just right and the gulls in the sky add to the scene.', '2007-07-10 01:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887802, 548106, 78255, '<td valign="top">It really is pretty. But I have to wonder if a different composition or angle would have created an even more compelling image? Maybe a vertical crop? I can''t decide actually. I think I like it both ways. :)</td>', 'It really is pretty. But I have to wonder if a different composition or angle would have created an even more compelling image? Maybe a vertical crop? I can''t decide actually. I think I like it both ways. :)', '2007-07-10 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
