(3887867, 546802, 78255, '<td valign="top">Great exposure, good light, nice composition. It works for me.</td>', 'Great exposure, good light, nice composition. It works for me.', '2007-07-10 01:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887868, 545212, 78255, '<td valign="top">Ah, there is that great light again. Plus you even have a gull at the water line. A special image very well done.</td>', 'Ah, there is that great light again. Plus you even have a gull at the water line. A special image very well done.', '2007-07-10 01:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887874, 547525, 78255, '<td valign="top">How can anyone not love this view?!? If good photography is getting the unique angle, I''d say you succeeded here.</td>', 'How can anyone not love this view?!? If good photography is getting the unique angle, I''d say you succeeded here.', '2007-07-10 01:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887876, 546336, 78255, '<td valign="top">The photo angels were smiling on you this week. How nice to have such a beautiful opportunity in the challenge time frame. Beautiful!</td>', 'The photo angels were smiling on you this week. How nice to have such a beautiful opportunity in the challenge time frame. Beautiful!', '2007-07-10 01:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887877, 546338, 78255, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective for me. The rocks in the foreground add a good amount of interest.</td>', 'Simple but effective for me. The rocks in the foreground add a good amount of interest.', '2007-07-10 01:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887880, 547308, 78255, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and exposure. Beautiful image!</td>', 'Very good composition and exposure. Beautiful image!', '2007-07-10 01:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887883, 547806, 78255, '<td valign="top">Great submission for this challenge. I like it.</td>', 'Great submission for this challenge. I like it.', '2007-07-10 01:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887888, 548081, 78255, '<td valign="top">So many shades of blue and the cliffs have amazing intricacies and coloring. Nothing like Mother Nature to inspire awe!</td>', 'So many shades of blue and the cliffs have amazing intricacies and coloring. Nothing like Mother Nature to inspire awe!', '2007-07-10 01:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887892, 545503, 78255, '<td valign="top">I like the way the water is so still around the guys. I think maybe a bit more water below them would have made a better balanced image.</td>', 'I like the way the water is so still around the guys. I think maybe a bit more water below them would have made a better balanced image.', '2007-07-10 02:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887893, 547660, 78255, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2007-07-10 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887895, 547891, 78255, '<td valign="top">Wow this is nice!</td>', 'Wow this is nice!', '2007-07-10 02:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887898, 546780, 78255, '<td valign="top">I love a fish-eye view so I know I am biased, but I like this image.</td>', 'I love a fish-eye view so I know I am biased, but I like this image.', '2007-07-10 02:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887911, 547478, 78255, '<td valign="top">Looks like it is a very beautiful place. The blurry torch doesn''t do anything for me though and being in the foreground makes it tough to get past. I understand the desire to get some foreground interest but this doesn''t work for me. There is also a serious tilt to your horizon line.</td>', 'Looks like it is a very beautiful place. The blurry torch doesn''t do anything for me though and being in the foreground makes it tough to get past. I understand the desire to get some foreground interest but this doesn''t work for me. There is also a serious tilt to your horizon line.', '2007-07-10 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887914, 547700, 78255, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work. You are good!</td>', 'Beautiful work. You are good!', '2007-07-10 02:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887919, 546660, 78255, '<td valign="top">Too sharp for me. I don''t know if this is from resizing or ? A beautiful image that the sharpening ruins for me. Still high marks in every other area.</td>', 'Too sharp for me. I don''t know if this is from resizing or ? A beautiful image that the sharpening ruins for me. Still high marks in every other area.', '2007-07-10 02:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887927, 547730, 78255, '<td valign="top">Great composition and the rendering of this image is perfect. Makes me want to be standing right where you were when you took this shot. Good work!</td>', 'Great composition and the rendering of this image is perfect. Makes me want to be standing right where you were when you took this shot. Good work!', '2007-07-10 02:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887931, 547971, 78255, '<td valign="top">I love this view and have to take at least a few shots every time I have the opportunity. I can''t say I''ve ever got as nice of shot as you have here though. Nice work! It looks like a relatively new pier right? The pilings around the piers I visit are not near as uniform.</td>', 'I love this view and have to take at least a few shots every time I have the opportunity. I can''t say I''ve ever got as nice of shot as you have here though. Nice work! It looks like a relatively new pier right? The pilings around the piers I visit are not near as uniform.', '2007-07-10 02:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887935, 544540, 78255, '<td valign="top">Hey, how did you do this? Is that ship really that close to shore? Looks like it would be stuck. An interesting image that kept me looking.</td>', 'Hey, how did you do this? Is that ship really that close to shore? Looks like it would be stuck. An interesting image that kept me looking.', '2007-07-10 02:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887939, 544789, 78255, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you will get many folks who will tell you that in a shot like this it will improve on the image to have the horizon straight. This is just a simple rotate in any editing program. Is that really a shark or a dolphin?</td>', 'I''m sure you will get many folks who will tell you that in a shot like this it will improve on the image to have the horizon straight. This is just a simple rotate in any editing program. Is that really a shark or a dolphin?', '2007-07-10 02:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
