(3891432, 544527, 56880, '<td valign="top">I liked how you framed this one, with the people in the lower right third.  The horizon is just below the midline of the frame, giving more emphasis to the sky and heavy clouds.  I think this should have scored at least a half point higher.</td>', 'I liked how you framed this one, with the people in the lower right third.  The horizon is just below the midline of the frame, giving more emphasis to the sky and heavy clouds.  I think this should have scored at least a half point higher.', '2007-07-11 01:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
