(3891925, 547891, 21807, '<td valign="top">Yeah! That''s what I like to see! That left looks sick, while dudes like JOB would pull into that sucking right.  Good to see that there''s waves elsewhere but Hawaii. Nice work man.</td>', 'Yeah! That''s what I like to see! That left looks sick, while dudes like JOB would pull into that sucking right.  Good to see that there''s waves elsewhere but Hawaii. Nice work man.', '2007-07-11 03:25:01.000000', NULL, 0),
