(3891999, 547660, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is sooo beautiful! Congrats on 5th place.</td>', 'This is sooo beautiful! Congrats on 5th place.', '2007-07-11 04:28:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3892010, 547281, 78356, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by foxinsox47:</b></div><hr/><i> Zoom in on your target!  We almost can''t see the boat :-(  Yes, you want us to get the point that it''s a small boat, but by making it *so* tiny, all we can really see are clouds.  Crop it as a vertical shot, about a quarter or a third of the width of this shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Didn''t you hear about primes?<br/>Can''t you see the boat in like many Kms away?<br/>I want to show the imensity of the sea-sky.</td>', 'Originally posted by foxinsox47: Zoom in on your target!  We almost can''t see the boat :-(  Yes, you want us to get the point that it''s a small boat, but by making it *so* tiny, all we can really see are clouds.  Crop it as a vertical shot, about a quarter or a third of the width of this shot.   Didn''t you hear about primes?Can''t you see the boat in like many Kms away?I want to show the imensity of the sea-sky.', '2007-07-11 04:36:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3892014, 547281, 78356, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Scholten:</b></div><hr/><i> Between all the other images with wonderful vibrant color, this looks dull as a B&amp;W </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You should judge an image by it''s own merits and not compared to the others.<br/>I like BW so what? It is not valid here?<br/> <br/>I will always get these kind of comments here?<br/> <br/>Anyway thanks for passing by.</td>', 'Originally posted by Scholten: Between all the other images with wonderful vibrant color, this looks dull as a B&W   You should judge an image by it''s own merits and not compared to the others.I like BW so what? It is not valid here? I will always get these kind of comments here? Anyway thanks for passing by.', '2007-07-11 04:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3892083, 547685, 45377, '<td valign="top">55 out of 121, not bad for my first challenge.<br/> <br/>This is the North Bay in Scarborough, UK. The stairs are part of the sea defense that was built a couple of years ago to help preserve the coastline. The stairs lead down to the beach but at high tide are almost completely submerged.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the votes and helpful comments.</td>', '55 out of 121, not bad for my first challenge. This is the North Bay in Scarborough, UK. The stairs are part of the sea defense that was built a couple of years ago to help preserve the coastline. The stairs lead down to the beach but at high tide are almost completely submerged. Thanks for all the votes and helpful comments.', '2007-07-11 05:44:24.000000', NULL, 0),
