(3892681, 548064, 68642, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone that voted and commented.  I have appreciated every comment that was written.  They were all helpful in some sort of way. <br/> <br/> It was a rather ordinary photo I wil admit.  I did snap a better picture of my friends on the dock in another picture, but they would have been the main focus instead of the water.  So thats why I went with this one instead.<br/> <br/>btw - this is where I do my boating during the summer. The photo was taken at the waterfront at my cottage.  :)<br/> <br/>thanks!</td>', 'Thanks to everyone that voted and commented.  I have appreciated every comment that was written.  They were all helpful in some sort of way.   It was a rather ordinary photo I wil admit.  I did snap a better picture of my friends on the dock in another picture, but they would have been the main focus instead of the water.  So thats why I went with this one instead. btw - this is where I do my boating during the summer. The photo was taken at the waterfront at my cottage.  :) thanks!', '2007-07-11 09:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
