(3893696, 547412, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hello dear friend and happy birthday to you!  Hope today has been a wonderful day!<br/> <br/>I sea no land so it MUST certainly be an open water shot.  The bird adds a wonderful element of grace to the photo.  Beautiful colors as well.  Some day you will have to tell me the words of the swan song... :D</td>', 'Hello dear friend and happy birthday to you!  Hope today has been a wonderful day! I sea no land so it MUST certainly be an open water shot.  The bird adds a wonderful element of grace to the photo.  Beautiful colors as well.  Some day you will have to tell me the words of the swan song... :D', '2007-07-11 12:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3893954, 544527, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m really surprised this didn''t finish higher.  Very lovely shot with a great B/W tonal range.  Perfect for the mood of the approaching storm.  The hands on the hips is classic.  :P  Quite easy to imagine being there...very nicely done!</td>', 'I''m really surprised this didn''t finish higher.  Very lovely shot with a great B/W tonal range.  Perfect for the mood of the approaching storm.  The hands on the hips is classic.  :P  Quite easy to imagine being there...very nicely done!', '2007-07-11 14:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
